    "name": "Final Signature",
    "steam_appid": 3600200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Signature is a single-player psychological horror game where you explore an abandoned hotel, search for hidden clues, and compete against other mysterious participants in a deadly game. As fear builds with each step, you\u2019ll need to decide who to trust\u2014and who to escape from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/80c36a4a47afe566a6f3ad611d5bfd2d.webp?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=13 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/5d4c6c11577367460a8a7b2040565417.webp?t=1754709424\" width=230 height=43 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and navigate through dark corridors and eerie rooms. De'Manor Hotel is a place seemingly frozen in time, with its gloomy hallways and dust-covered, abandoned lounges. Once renowned for its luxury and grandeur, the hotel is now nothing more than a sinister relic filled with whispers and shadows. The damp smell and the creaking wooden floors create an unsettling sensation\u2014as if something is always watching you from behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/80c36a4a47afe566a6f3ad611d5bfd2d.webp?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=13 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/3bdd81ec32d7904995e40c9df5d8c575.webp?t=1754709424\" width=230 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Miller, a desperate father facing financial ruin, receives a mysterious invitation on his computer: participate in a deadly game at a remote hotel to win a prize that could save his cancer-stricken daughter.<br>Set in the decrepit De'Manor Hotel, players must explore its haunted halls, evade enemies, uncover clues, and solve the building\u2019s chilling mysteries. Final Signature is played from a first-person perspective and challenges players to survive, no matter the cost. But this hotel hides more than just secrets\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/80c36a4a47afe566a6f3ad611d5bfd2d.webp?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=13 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/d83b10e4d49584edabef005fce2182f1.webp?t=1754709424\" width=230 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter, there is no way out. Everyone has a different reason for being here\u2014but no one is truly alone.<br>To claim the ultimate prize, you must push your limits and uncover the hotel\u2019s darkest secrets. As the game progresses, your perception of reality may begin to distort. And eventually, you\u2019ll learn that trusting anyone is a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/80c36a4a47afe566a6f3ad611d5bfd2d.webp?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=13 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/5385184244d18c5a0c3b0816daa2e76e.webp?t=1754709424\" width=230 height=43 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mask. A pen. A contract signed in blood.<br>Everything has a price. If you want to win at De'Manor Hotel, first decide what you're willing to sacrifice.<br>Just one signature... and there\u2019s no turning back.<br>Take your chances. But remember: some contracts can only be broken in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/6d7debf00a937fe3578a0cb258ee3775.poster.avif?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/6d7debf00a937fe3578a0cb258ee3775.webm?t=1754709424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/6d7debf00a937fe3578a0cb258ee3775.mp4?t=1754709424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/498c1ec75c0ec4981a6e9ab3cae7baa8.webp?t=1754709424\" width=230 height=43 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door creaks open\u2014but you\u2019ll never know what truly lies inside.<br>Silence is not safety. Behind some doors, there\u2019s more than just darkness... sometimes, a pair of eyes watches from within.<br>Fear doesn\u2019t always begin with a scream\u2014it begins with silence.<br>Every room has a story. Every shadow belongs to someone.<br>Do you dare to enter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/b1997796b28b15bc3bff741506259d6e.poster.avif?t=1754709424\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/b1997796b28b15bc3bff741506259d6e.webm?t=1754709424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600200/extras/b1997796b28b15bc3bff741506259d6e.mp4?t=1754709424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVELOPER\u2019S WARNING:</strong> Those who fear darkness, suffer from claustrophobia, or feel uneasy when alone are advised <strong>not to play this game alone</strong>. <strong>Final Signature</strong> offers an experience that only the brave can endure until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Notice:</strong> This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, locations, and events are purely fictional or used fictitiously<strong>.</strong> Any resemblance to real events, places, or living/deceased persons is entirely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game may trigger seizures in players with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
